WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.762
Your stacks share one Caddy. Turn on plain HTTP and choose its ports.

00:05.212 --> 00:09.113
The shared Caddy settings turn on plain HTTP and set both ports.

00:09.563 --> 00:10.863
Start the stack.

00:11.313 --> 00:14.007
The HTTPS address now uses the port you set.

00:14.457 --> 00:16.779
The service answers over HTTPS.

00:17.857 --> 00:20.458
The same service answers over plain HTTP.

00:23.137 --> 00:24.159
Stop the stack.
